Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:43.97,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑客帝国2：重装上阵》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官！你确定这样行得通吗？- 我说过 不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, are you sure about this? - I told you, we're going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 只是我侦测到有大量乌贼在行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, sir. It's just that I'm scoping some serious sentinel activity up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 林克！- 是的！长官！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Link. - Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你的状况而言…我不太明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given your situation, I can't say I understand your reasons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何自愿成为我的队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for volunteering to operate onboard my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外…你要是希望继续做下去 有件事我希望你能办到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, if you wish to continue to do so, I must ask you to do one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是！长官！我会的！长官！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. I will, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说我相信你！长官！- 希望如此！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, I do, sir. - I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么把主电源都接上… 准备开始广播了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repatch the main AC to the hard drives and stand by to broadcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！长官！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是睡不着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still can't sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要聊聊天吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是场梦罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是在害怕某些事情？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're afraid of something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常的希望…我只想知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish… I wish I knew what I'm supposed to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我能知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会联络我们的 别担心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna call. Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们俩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 我们已经迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we ready to go? - We're already late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些地热图确认了奥西里斯… 被毁前传出来的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These geotherms confirm the last transmission of the Osiris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器正在往下挖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines are digging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们打算从地面挖到锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're boring from the surface down to Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶！- 那就避开了我们的第一道防线！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mother… - They'll avoid the perimeter defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度有多快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fast are they moving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心预计它们的时速是每小时一百米 该死的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control estimates their descent at 100 meters an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们已经挖到多深了？- 两千米左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How deep are they? - Almost 2000 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥西里斯传来的消息呢？- 未必准确吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the scans from the Osiris? - They can't be accurate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许正确？- 不可能的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They may be. - It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说有二十五万只乌贼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd mean there are a quarter- million sentinels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完全正确！- 不可能！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - That can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不可能？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,锡安内的每个男女老幼都由… 一只乌贼来对付{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sentinel for every man, woman and child in Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很符合电脑的逻辑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds exactly like the thinking of a machine to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思！很高兴你能参与{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus, glad you could join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奥比！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我的迟到我向大家道歉 相信你也知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies to all. But as you are undoubtedly aware…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近是越来越难以找到 一个安全的广播地点了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's become difficult to locate a secure broadcast position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乌贼占据了最好的广播点 - 主干线上爬满了这些家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Squiddies got our best spots. - Lines are crawling with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如奈奥比没错的话 三天内将会有二十五万只乌贼在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Niobe's right, in 72 hours there's gonna be a quarter- million more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将遵从洛克指挥官的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do what Commander Lock ordered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上撤消广播然后返回锡安去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll evacuate broadcast level and return to Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么指挥官是否有任何对付 这二十五万只乌贼的办法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And does the commander have a plan for stopping 250, 000 sentinels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,策略还在拟定中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A strategy is still being formulated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是那么认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么做…莫费思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think we should do, Morpheus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们认为大家都应该听从命令 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should proceed as ordered… - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我需要一个人来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - …however, I must ask one of you for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人跟我有同样的想法 但也有些人不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you believe as I believe, some of you do not. Those of you that do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是赞同我的人应该知道 这场战争已经快到尾声了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…know we are nearing the end of our struggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过不久预言将会实现 但是在它还没实现前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prophecy will be fulfilled soon. But before it can be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去征询先知的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Oracle must be consulted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我现在就回去补充装备的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we return and recharge now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在三十六个小时内返回 在那些机器到达这里之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we can be back in 36 hours, well before the machines reach this depth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what you're asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在要求一艘战舰留下来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am asking that one ship remain here in our place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来等待先知和我们联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in case the Oracle should attempt to contact us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,放屁！你在要求我们违背上头的命令！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit. You're asking one of us to disobey a direct order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！没错！但我们之所以能够在这里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, I am. But we well know that the reason most of us are here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为我们都有叛逆精神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is because of our affinity for disobedience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要是你回到锡安后 被关进小黑屋里去了怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you get to Zion and the commander throws you in the stockade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！你这臭脾气还是一点都没变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, Morpheus, you ain't never gonna change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我留下！看看她敢不敢动你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, I'll do it just to see what Deadbolt does to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有三十六小时的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got 36 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找尼欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有听说过这个人 - 我有些东西要给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never heard of him. - I have something for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…他让我自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, he set me free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦！随便你！滚吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, whatever. Now piss off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁来了？- 你怎么知道有人来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was that? - How did you know someone was here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说给你这玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是你让他得到了自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you set him free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！有什么不对劲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议结束了 赶快返回战舰去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The meeting is over. Retreat to your exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特警来了 - 特警？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agents are coming. - Agents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是他！- 那个异类！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's him. - The anomaly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要上吗？- 那当然！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we proceed? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他也只不过… - 是个血肉之躯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is still… - Only human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！升级版{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upgrades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正如我所料！- 没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That went as expected. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟以前一模一样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening exactly as before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不尽然！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 林克！刚才是怎么回事？- 不知道！长官！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I can't figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,特警突然冒了出来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents just came out of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而编码也变得很古怪 从没见过的加密方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the code got all weird. Encryption I've never seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼欧还好吗？- 当然没事 莫费思 你该看看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ls Neo okay? - Okay? Shit, you should've seen him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪？他正在做超人做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now? He's doing his Superman thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是尼布加尼撒号 请求进入三号闸门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Nebuchadnezzar, requesting access through Gate Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼布加尼撒 这里是锡安控制台 保持你的速度 等待指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nebuchadnezzar, this is Zion Control. Maintain present velocity and stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 控制台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是锡安控制台 要求三号闸门的对敌武器装备暂停警戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Control requesting immediate stand- down of arms at Gate Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼布加尼撒号返航 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the Nebuchadnezzar on approach. Let's open her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼布加尼撒 进了三号闸门后 请在七号降落台降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are cleared through Gate Three to Bay Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 控制台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,门开了 床铺好了 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door's open, bed's made. Welcome home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家的感觉真好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No place like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 控制台 请准备关闭三号门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Control. Zion Control, stand by for Gate Three lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼布加尼撒开始降落 在七号降落台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nebuchadnezzar is down. Bay Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦凡利上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Mifune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 你可是来押我去小黑屋的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here to escort me to the stockade, captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是来调解的 - 洛克指挥官命令…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just here to keep the peace. - Commander Lock demands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要求你立即去见他 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requests your immediate counsel, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 林克 - 什么事 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Link. - Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要尼布加尼撒号在最短的时间内 做好起航准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the ship ready to go as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们之间发生了什么事？- 莫费思跟洛克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it between them? - Morpheus and Lock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奈奥比 - 奈奥比上尉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Niobe. - Captain Niobe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以前是莫费思的女友 现在却跟了洛克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to be with Morpheus. Now she's with Lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思去见了先知 然后 一切都变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus went to the Oracle. After that, everything changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！那真像她的作风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she can do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.07,0:15:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧！- 他怎么每次都知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - How does he always know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他没别的事情做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't he have anything better to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫你救了他一命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say about the life you save.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没救过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't save his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 崔妮蒂 林克 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trinity, Link. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来了 真是太好了 - 谢谢 我也很高兴能回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's great to have you back. - Thanks. It's good to be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以帮你拿吗 尼欧？- 不用了 我自己来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I carry that for you? - No, I can carry my own bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 崔妮蒂？- 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trinity? - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你帮忙拿这些吧！- 好的！没问题 林克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can carry these. - Yeah, sure, Link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你知道吗 明年我就能上战舰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know, next year I'm old enough to join a crew, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了好久 终于下定决心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about it, and I've made my decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算加入尼布加尼撒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to join the Nebuchadnezzar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道莫费思还没决定其他人选 除了你之外 林克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus hasn't filled the other positions, except for you, Link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定有原因！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he has reasons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得命中注定要加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the more I think about it, the more I think it's meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 这就是我的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是我在这儿的目的 - 我已经告诉过你了 孩子 是你找到了我 并非我找到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the reason I'm here, Neo. - I told you, you found me. I didn't find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是你救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but you got me out. You saved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你救了你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫费思 - 洛克指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morpheus. - Commander Lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟其他上尉聊过了 我想要给你一个解释你的行动的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke to the other captains. I wanted to offer you a chance to explain your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道有什么好解释的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't aware that my actions required any explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直接下达命令要求大家返回锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were given an order to return to Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我回来了 - 但是你却要求一艘战舰留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did. - You asked for one ship to remain behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是宁可自己留下的 可惜我的战舰需要补充装备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have stayed, but I needed to recharge my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你承认你的失职吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you admit to a direct contravention of your duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 我们需要一个人留在母体内 等待先知的联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a presence inside the Matrix to await contact from the Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听这种的屁话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear that shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管什么先知、预言、神迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about oracles or prophecies or messiahs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在乎一件事 阻止机器军团毁掉这个城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care about one thing: Stopping that army from destroying this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这个 我需要士兵们听令于我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do that I need soldiers to obey my orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常的尊敬你 指挥官 但是只有一个方法能够拯救这个城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, commander, there is only one way to save our city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么方法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼欧 - 该死的 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neo. - Goddamn it, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都相信你这一套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone believes what you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要每个人都相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beliefs do not require them to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.51,0:17:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚有个聚会 大家都在谈论这件事 很多人都很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a gathering tonight. Everyone's talking. A lot of people are scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次居然有那多的战舰聚集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one remembers the last time so many ships were docked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有事情发生了 是吧？- 嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something big is happening, isn't it? - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能透露任何事 别再问了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not allowed to say anything, so stop asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 回家的感觉真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn, it's good to be home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会向议会请求将你革职{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm recommending that you be removed from duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的特权 指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, of course, your prerogative, commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 假如我能作主的话 你这辈子都别想回到你的战舰上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it were up to me, you wouldn't set foot on a ship for the rest of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倍感庆幸的是你还不能作主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I am grateful that it is not up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍曼议员 - 指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Councillor Hamann. - Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上尉 - 议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Councillor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,议会要我在今晚的神殿聚会上致辞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Council's asked me to speak tonight at the temple gathering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,得正面回应敌人的存在和那个谣言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The presence of the fleet and the persistence of rumors must be addressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民有权知道发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people must be told what is happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然 议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, councillor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我建议你不要透露细节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But might I advise a level of discretion concerning specific details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不希望引起恐慌 - 有道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We do not wish to start a panic. - Quite right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不想引起恐慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A panic is not what anyone wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的看法呢？上尉？你有什么建议？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, captain? What would you advise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出真相 没人会恐慌 因为根本没什么好恐慌的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth. No one will panic, because there is nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的军队永远都到不了锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That army won't reach the gates of Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为何能这么肯定？- 根据我们所看到的一切 议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What makes you so sure? - Consider what we have seen, councillor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这六个月以来 被解放的人比六年来还多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider that in the past six months, we have freed more minds than in six years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次攻击是电脑情急的反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This attack is an act of desperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信过不了多久预言就会实现 这场战争即将结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe very soon the prophecy will be fulfilled and this war will end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你是对的 上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're right, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深信那不是希望 议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe it to be a matter of hope, councillor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迟早要发生的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is simply a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.13,0:19:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望别太快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully not too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！孩子！他们俩还有事情要办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, kid. These two got things to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想我正在想的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you thinking what I'm thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也觉得电梯走的太慢了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am if you're thinking this elevator is too slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的战舰补充装备需要多少时间？- 二十四 或许三十个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long do we charge the Neb? - Twenty-four, maybe 30 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子听过最好的好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people go their entire lives without hearing news that good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧 拜托了 我有个孩子 他叫耶谷 在诺瓦西斯战舰上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo, please, I have a son, Jacob, aboard the Gnosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托你 帮我照顾他 - 我尽力而为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, watch over him. - I'll try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个女儿在易卡露斯战舰上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a daughter on the lcarus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 没事的 他们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. They need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我需要你 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my puss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 林克叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Uncle Link!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！呵呵呵…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,林克叔叔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Link!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊！你们都长这么大啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! You're so huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该轮到你把我举起来了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should be picking me up! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要啦！- 好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们大家一起努力 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're gonna have to work together here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 用力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, lift!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！老天 他们都吃了什么啊 长那么快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! What are you feeding these two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！孩子们 该上床了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kids. It's time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.41,0:21:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 凯丝 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Cas. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴看你回来 林克 - 家才是最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to have you home, Link. - Good to be home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要好好对待她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be careful with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我 该担心的人是他自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me. He's the one that's gonna get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧！你们俩 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out the door! Both of you, march!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye! - Bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该担心什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,每艘战舰的回家次数都比 尼布加尼撒多了两三倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every ship up there's been home two, even three times more than the Nebuchadnezzar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.71,0:22:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样啦 姬儿 我们不是已经说好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Zee. I thought we were past this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等你调到其它战舰之后我才能放心 - 我不能那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We will be when you operate another ship. - I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 你知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - You know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.95,0:22:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是道瑟知道我的感受 他一定不会让你去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Dozer knew how I felt, he wouldn't have asked you to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.85,0:22:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧！但是现在太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. But it's too late now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我作了个承诺 有些承诺是不能反悔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise, and some promises can't be unmade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不公平！- 没有人说它公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not fair. - Nobody said it was gonna be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你认为我活了下来而 道瑟死了凯丝会觉得公平吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Cas thinks it's fair that I'm here and Dozer's not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两个哥哥都在那艘战舰上死了 林克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost two brothers to that ship, Link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.41,0:22:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.21,0:22:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕还会失去你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it's gonna take you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.48,0:22:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能那么确定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有莫费思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.61,0:22:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他说的话 他说时候到了 战争很快就会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what he's told me. He said that this is it, that it will be over soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:23:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 林克！莫费思疯了 - 没人怀疑这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Link, Morpheus is crazy. - No doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.11,0:23:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是坦克跟道瑟也相信他 而且我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Tank and Dozer believed him. And I'll tell you what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.47,0:23:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在战舰上看到尼欧的种种能力时 我不得不说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after being on that ship and seeing Neo do the things he can do, I gotta say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也相信他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm starting to believe him too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.13,0:23:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 林克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, Link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.89,0:23:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.35,0:23:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始了吗？- 霍曼议员刚开始祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They started yet? - Only Councillor Hamann's opening prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.92,0:23:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 让我们向这些勇士们致敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, let us honor these men and women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些 我们的士兵 我们的自由战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are our soldiers, our warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些 我们的丈夫和妻子 我们的兄弟姐妹…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are our husbands and wives, our brothers and sisters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将永远怀念那些牺牲的人们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us remember those that have been lost…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:24:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也为生还者能与我们同在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and let us give thanks for those that have been found…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.31,0:24:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着一颗感恩的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and who stand here beside us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要请另一个人上来致辞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I would like someone else to close this prayer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.63,0:24:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个已经很久没在这说话的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…someone who hasn't spoken here in a long time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.00,0:24:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们一定要聆听他说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but who I believe has something to say that we all need to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们欢迎莫费思！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.45,0:24:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,锡安的同胞们！听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zion! Hear me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.61,0:24:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所听说的大部分都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true what many of you have heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.91,0:24:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑召集的机器兵团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines have gathered an army, and as I speak…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在逼近我们的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that army is drawing nearer to our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.44,0:25:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将有一场艰苦的硬战要打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me when I say we have a difficult time ahead of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.77,0:25:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要赢得这场战争的胜利 首先就要排除内心的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we are to be prepared for it, we must first shed our fear of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.43,0:25:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在 站在这里 心中毫无惧意！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand here before you now truthfully unafraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.93,0:25:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.09,0:25:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我跟你们有着不同的信念吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I believe something you do not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.14,0:25:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.22,0:25:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能毫无畏惧地站在这 是因为我记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand here without fear because I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.42,0:25:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我之所以能在这里 不是因为遵从前人所铺下的道路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that I am here not because of the path that lies before me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是相信自己能创造属于我们自己的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but because of the path that lies behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.66,0:25:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我们跟这些机器对抗了百余年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that for 100 years we have fought these machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.68,0:25:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得这百年来 它们不断地派军队来 企图消灭我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that for 100 years they have sent their armies to destroy us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.78,0:25:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过了这一个世纪的战争 我记得 最重要的一件事是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after a century of war, I remember that which matters most:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.61,0:25:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依然活着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are still here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.33,0:26:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.77,0:26:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们向机器兵团宣战！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iet us send a message to that army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.19,0:26:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 让这里因我们而震动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, let us shake this cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.45,0:26:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 让这儿的大地、钢铁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, let us tremble these halls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.36,0:26:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头都因我们而颤抖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of earth, steel and stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的呐喊由火红的地底 直达乌黑的天空！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us be heard from red core to black sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.05,0:26:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们要让它们记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, let us make them remember:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.75,0:26:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是锡安！而我们无所畏惧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Zion and we are not afraid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.07,0:27:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你会跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you used to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.13,0:27:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你跳得很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you were pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.16,0:27:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奥比上尉 这世上有些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some things in this world, Captain Niobe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.19,0:27:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是永远不会变的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that will never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.29,0:27:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奥比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niobe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.89,0:27:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些事情却改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things do change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.11,0:27:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.76,0:28:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好想你 - 我能感觉到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I missed you. - I can tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.69,0:28:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 既然大家都在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking, everyone is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.96,0:28:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就跟我来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.24,0:31:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.14,0:31:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对劲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.97,0:31:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧的 你可以告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, you can tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.67,0:31:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.34,0:31:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.30,0:31:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能失去你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.80,0:31:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会失去我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna lose me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.80,0:31:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.83,0:31:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会离开你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never letting go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.63,0:32:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你有个美梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.46,0:32:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - I'll make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.29,0:32:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过那么厉害的特警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that agent? I've never seen anything like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.09,0:32:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那无关紧要 最重要的是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. All that matters is this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.49,0:33:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 天啊 - 叫我史密斯就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - "Smith" will suffice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.29,0:33:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.51,0:34:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以跟你聊聊吗？- 霍曼议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Care for some company? - Councillor Hamann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.68,0:34:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你喜欢单独一个人的话 那么我就不打扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to intrude if you'd prefer to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.94,0:34:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我也想聊聊天 - 那就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I could probably use some company. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想和你聊聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So could l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.44,0:34:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.44,0:34:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常平静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.04,0:34:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像每个人都睡得很安稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like everyone is sleeping very peacefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.17,0:34:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非每个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.11,0:34:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌睡觉 通常只睡几小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate sleeping. I never sleep more than a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.97,0:34:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生中 前十一年都在沉睡 我不想再浪费时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure I slept the first 11 years of my life, now I'm making up for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.47,0:35:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你呢？- 我最近一直睡得不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - I just haven't been able to sleep much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是个好兆头 - 怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a good sign. - Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.97,0:35:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明你还是个…活生生的人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you are in fact still human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.74,0:35:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去过为锡安提供能源的地方吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever been to the engineering level?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.84,0:35:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢晚上在那散步 很神奇的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love to walk there at night. It's quite amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.04,0:35:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想去吗？- 好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like to see it? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.23,0:35:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎没人会来这儿 除非机器出了问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost no one comes down here. Unless, of course, there's a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.87,0:35:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是这样 只要不出事 没人会去管它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it is with people. Nobody cares how it works as long as it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.57,0:35:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这城市靠这些机器才存活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be reminded this city survives because of these machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.53,0:35:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些机器让我们活下来 别的机器却要来杀我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These machines are keeping us alive while other machines are coming to kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.06,0:36:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣 不是吗？赐予生命的力量…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting, isn't it? The power to give life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.06,0:36:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …也能夺走生命 - 我们也有相同的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and the power to end it. - We have the same power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.43,0:36:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 或许吧！但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I suppose we do, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.33,0:36:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我想到那些还受母体控制的人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sometimes I think about those people still plugged into the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.96,0:36:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且当我看着这些机器的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I look at these machines…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.13,0:36:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁不住会想说 就某方面而言 我们不也是受这些机器的控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I can't help thinking that, in a way, we are plugged into them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.49,0:36:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些机器是由我们控制的 它们不会反过来控制我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we control these machines, they don't control us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.79,0:36:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会了！它们怎么可能呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. How could they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个想法实在太过荒谬…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea is pure nonsense…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.99,0:36:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不禁让人深思…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it does make one wonder just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.29,0:36:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是「控制」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what is control?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们随时可以把这些机器关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wanted, we could shut these machines down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.52,0:36:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然 就是这样 这就是「控制」 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. That's it. You hit it. That's control, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.62,0:36:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们想 把它们砸成碎片都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wanted, we could smash them to bits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.22,0:36:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但假如真的那么做了 我们就没了灯光…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although if we did, we'd have to consider what would happen to our lights…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.56,0:36:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,热能、空气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our heat, our air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.19,0:36:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们需要机器 而它们也需要我们 这就是你想强调的吗 议员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we need machines and they need us. Is that your point, councillor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没什么好强调的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.82,0:37:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这种老头子 不喜欢强调什么 不需要强调什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old men like me don't bother with making points. There's no point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.69,0:37:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是否就是议会没有年轻人的原因？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why there are no young men on the Council?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.72,0:37:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.02,0:37:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么话就直说吧！议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me what's on your mind, councillor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.35,0:37:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上有很多事情…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is so much in this world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.78,0:37:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我所不了解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那架机器吗？它是我们的主水源再循环系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that machine? It has something to do with recycling our water supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.63,0:37:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道它是怎么运作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have absolutely no idea how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.63,0:37:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我了解它是用来干什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do understand the reason for it to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.15,0:37:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也完全不知道 你是如何能在母体内办到那些事情的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have absolutely no idea how you are able to do some of the things you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.81,0:37:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我确信那也是为了某个目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe there's a reason for that as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望我们能够理解那个目的 在事情还不至于无法挽回前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only hope we understand that reason before it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.48,0:38:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴勒 - 他在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ballard. - ls he here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.58,0:38:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧 这是先知给的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo, it's from the Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.11,0:38:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候启程了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.78,0:38:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思早就说这会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus said this was how it was gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.94,0:38:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能那个预言是真的 也可能不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe the prophecy's true, maybe it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.37,0:38:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道那艘战舰急需一个接线员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, that ship needs an operator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.11,0:38:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 那个接线员就是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, that operator's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.61,0:38:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.64,0:38:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的！- 我要你戴上它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zee… - I want you to wear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.69,0:38:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我不相信这些东西的 - 但是我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know I don't believe in this stuff. - But I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.87,0:38:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它总是给我带来好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always brought me luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.97,0:38:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许它也能给你带来好运 - 我会平安回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe it'll bring me you. - I'm coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.51,0:38:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 不管付出多少代价 我都会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise. No matter what it takes, I'm coming home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.54,0:38:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它戴上就行了 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep it with you. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.30,0:38:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是为了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.80,0:39:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.56,0:39:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼欧！- 搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neo! - How the hell…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,班尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.50,0:39:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.19,0:39:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想来跟你说一声…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to catch you to say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.03,0:39:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.33,0:39:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.20,0:39:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会再见的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.19,0:39:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧！幸好赶上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo! Just in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.43,0:39:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要去找先知 对吧？- 我们没时间聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna see the Oracle? - There's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.25,0:39:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些东西要交给尼欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to give something to Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.26,0:39:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个孤儿送给你的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift from one of the orphans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.99,0:39:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫我一定要在你走之前给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made me swear to get it to you before you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.43,0:40:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你看到就会明白的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you'd understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚听说你批准了尼布加尼撒的出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just told you cleared the Nebuchadnezzar for takeoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.11,0:40:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.99,0:40:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 议员 我还是不是我们防御系统的主管？- 当然是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I still in charge of our defense system? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.12,0:40:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 如果要在这场攻击中存活下来 就必须保留我们的每一艘战舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I need every ship we have if we're going to survive this attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.72,0:40:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that, commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.60,0:40:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么允许尼布加尼撒离开？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you allow the Nebuchadnezzar to leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.01,0:40:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我相信我们的存亡 不是取决于我们有多少艘战舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I believe our survival depends on more than how many ships we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.19,0:40:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.78,0:41:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.28,0:41:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是来找先知的吧！- 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You seek the Oracle. - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.88,0:41:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是守护天使 我可以带你去见她 但我要先向你道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Seraph. I can take you to her, but first I must apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.61,0:41:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要先道歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologize for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.98,0:41:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.04,0:42:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.77,0:42:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,先知有很多敌人 我不得不先确认一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Oracle has many enemies. I had to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确认什么？- 确认你就是救世主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of what? - That you are the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.77,0:42:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直接问我不就得了 - 不 只有通过真正的交手…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could have just asked. - No. You do not truly know someone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.31,0:42:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能完全了解一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until you fight them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.50,0:42:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！她在等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. She's waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.23,0:43:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是后门 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are back doors, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.25,0:43:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,程序员设计的秘密通道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Programmer access.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.13,0:43:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是如何操作的？- 锁定机制内藏着一组密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do they work? - A code is hidden in tumblers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.09,0:43:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个密码能打开一扇门 而其它的密码能够打开其它的门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One position opens a lock and another position opens one of these doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.79,0:43:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个程序员吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a programmer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.79,0:43:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.29,0:43:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责保护重要人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I protect that which matters most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.59,0:44:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧！我不会咬你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on. I ain't gonna bite you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.39,0:44:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来 让我好好看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come around here and let me have a look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪 看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness, look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.10,0:44:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在看起来挺好的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned out all right, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.14,0:44:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉如何呢？- 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you feel? - l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.51,0:44:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你失眠 我们迟些再谈那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not sleeping. We'll get to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.25,0:44:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在过来陪我坐坐吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come and have a sit this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.68,0:44:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是站着比较好 - 哦 那随便你吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I'll stand. - Well, suit yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.93,0:44:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是坐下来吧！- 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I felt like sitting. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.64,0:44:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就开门见山地说吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iet's get the obvious stuff out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.38,0:44:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是人类 是吧？- 呵呵 你还真是非常的直接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not human, are you? - It's tough to get more obvious than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.02,0:45:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我猜的没错 你是电脑里的一个程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had to guess, I'd say you're a program from the machine world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.22,0:45:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他也是 - 目前为止 都猜对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So is he. - So far, so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.59,0:45:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这代表你也是母体的一分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if that's true, that could mean you're part of this system…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.93,0:45:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一种控制人的机制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…another kind of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.70,0:45:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接着说 - 那么我认为 最明显的问题是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep going. - I suppose the most obvious question is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.37,0:45:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …我怎么能相信你？- 问对了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …how can I trust you? - Bingo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.31,0:45:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毫无疑问是个难题 但坏消息是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a pickle, no doubt about it. Bad news is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.74,0:45:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没有办法知道 我是不是真的在帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's no way you can really know if I'm here to help you or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.58,0:45:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这完全取决于你 所以你得好好做出自己的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's really up to you. Just have to make up your own damn mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.28,0:45:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么接受我将告诉你的事 要么拒绝它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to either accept what I'm going to tell you or reject it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.39,0:45:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃糖吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.26,0:45:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你已经知道我是否会接受？- 要是我不知道的话 我就不是先知了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you already know if I'll take it? - Wouldn't be much of an oracle if I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.34,0:45:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你早就知道了 我又怎么选择？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you already know, how can I make a choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.28,0:45:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不是来这儿做选择的 你早已做出了选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you didn't come here to make the choice. You've already made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.44,0:46:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿的目的是想了解 你为什么要这样选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here to try to understand why you made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.62,0:46:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你早已想通这点了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd have figured that out by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.32,0:46:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你为什么来这儿？- 跟以前一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you here? - Same reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.16,0:46:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢吃糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.06,0:46:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你为什么肯帮我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.06,0:46:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是来做我们该做的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all here to do what we're all here to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.13,0:46:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只对一件事情感兴趣 未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm interested in one thing, Neo: the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.01,0:46:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我很清楚一点 就是只有我们团结一致才能有美好的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me, I know, the only way to get there is together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.41,0:46:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是否还有其它像你这样的程序？- 喔 没有跟我一样 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are there other programs like you? - Well, not like me, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.54,0:46:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 看到那些鸟儿了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. See those birds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.42,0:46:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从某种角度来讲 某个程序是为管理它们而编写的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At some point, a program was written to govern them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.99,0:46:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而为了管理树木、风、日出与日落 又编写了另一个程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A program was written to watch over the trees and the wind, the sunrise and sunset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.95,0:46:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有无数的程序在运行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are programs running all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.06,0:47:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些程序各司其职 但它们是无形的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones doing their job, doing what they were meant to do, are invisible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.45,0:47:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不会意识到它们的存在 但另外的一些程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd never even know they were here. But the other ones…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.77,0:47:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！我们常常都能够听说到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you hear about them all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.41,0:47:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可从来没听说过 - 你有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've never heard of them. - Of course you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.48,0:47:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当有人说他撞到了鬼 或者遇见天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you've heard someone say they saw a ghost or an angel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所听到的每一个关于吸血鬼 狼人 外星人之类的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every story you've ever heard about vampires, werewolves or aliens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.88,0:47:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些全是电脑主机在处理…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the system assimilating some program…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.82,0:47:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了问题的电脑程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's doing something they're not supposed to be doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.63,0:47:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,程序在入侵主机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Programs hacking programs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.83,0:47:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么会这样？- 它们有它们自己的理由…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - They have their reasons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.14,0:47:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们宁愿被驱逐 也不愿被删除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but usually a program chooses exile when it faces deletion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.24,0:47:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么它们会被删除？- 可能程序崩溃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And why would a program be deleted? - Maybe it breaks down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.30,0:47:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有更好的程序要来替代它了 这些事情一直在发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a better program is created to replace it. Happens all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.46,0:47:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且当要发生的时候 它们要么选择隐藏在母体里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it does, a program can either choose to hide here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.38,0:47:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就选择返回到代码之源去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or return to the source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.53,0:48:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是电脑主机那里？- 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The machine mainframe. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.96,0:48:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿就是你必须去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.63,0:48:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是救世主的终点站 你曾经见过的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the path of the One ends. You've seen it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.00,0:48:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的梦里 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in your dreams, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.06,0:48:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那道充满光芒的门？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A door made of light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.11,0:48:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进门之后发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you go through the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.78,0:48:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了崔妮蒂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see Trinity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.95,0:48:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一些事情发生了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and something happens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.29,0:48:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.36,0:48:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在往下坠落 然后我就醒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She starts to fall, and then I wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.43,0:48:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到她死去吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see her die? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.10,0:48:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有了预知能力！尼欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the sight now, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.31,0:48:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的能力不受时空的限制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking at the world without time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.48,0:48:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为什么我看不到她后来怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why can't I see what happens to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.43,0:48:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是无法看透自己所不理解的选择的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can never see past the choices we don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.67,0:48:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是说 我得自己选择崔妮蒂的命运？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying I have to choose whether Trinity lives or dies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.42,0:49:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你早已做出了选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you've already made the choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.36,0:49:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你只能去理解选择背后的意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you have to understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.53,0:49:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.06,0:49:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会那样做的！绝对不会！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that. I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.03,0:49:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须那么做 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you have to. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.00,0:49:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是救世主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.27,0:49:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要是我办不到呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.41,0:49:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我失败了会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if I fail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.01,0:49:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么锡安将会沦陷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Zion will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.49,0:49:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间又到了 相信我 尼欧！你能够拯救锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our time is up. Listen to me, Neo. You can save Zion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.21,0:49:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你去到代码之源 在那之前 你必须先找到掌握钥匙的那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you reach the source, but to do that you need the Keymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.03,0:49:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握钥匙的那个人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Keymaker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.20,0:49:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他曾经消失过一段时间 没人知道他发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He disappeared. We didn't know what happened to him until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.00,0:49:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最近听说 他被一个非常危险的程序抓了起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being held prisoner by a very dangerous program…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.82,0:49:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中最老的程序之一 他的名字叫梅罗纹奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one of the oldest of us. He is called the Merovingian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.37,0:49:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不会轻易放他走的 - 他想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And he won't let him go willingly. - What does he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.68,0:50:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些有权有势的人都想要什么？更多的权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do all men with power want? More power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.22,0:50:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那儿去 只要选择好时机…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there at that exact time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.62,0:50:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就有机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you will have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.09,0:50:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.53,0:50:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像每次和你见面都只会带来坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like every time we meet I got nothing but bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.47,0:50:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此感到抱歉 真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about that. I surely am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.54,0:50:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但值得庆幸的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for what it's worth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.30,0:50:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于选择了相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you've made a believer out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.27,0:50:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.32,0:50:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.39,0:51:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到我的礼物了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get my package?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.56,0:51:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到了 - 哦 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.89,0:51:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史密斯？- 它完全不像是特警的代码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smith? - He's not reading like an agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到我 很吃惊吧？- 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Surprised to see me? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.09,0:51:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你已经知道了吗？- 知道什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then you're aware of it. - Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.76,0:51:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间的联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.92,0:51:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是很清楚它到底是怎么产生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fully understand how it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.76,0:51:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是你的一部分代码 写进了我的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps some part of you imprinted onto me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.29,0:51:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些程序被覆盖 或者被复制了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something overwritten or copied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.12,0:51:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在那些都无关紧要了 重点是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, at this point, irrelevant. What matters is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.99,0:51:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切事情的发生 总有原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that whatever happened, happened for a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.26,0:51:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么原因呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what reason is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.39,0:51:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经杀了你 安德森先生 我亲眼目睹着你死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed you, Mr. Anderson. I watched you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.49,0:51:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 那给了我某种满足感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a certain satisfaction, I might add.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.92,0:51:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后发生了一件事 一件我认为不可能发生的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then something happened, something that I knew was impossible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.59,0:51:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it happened anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.12,0:51:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摧毁了我 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You destroyed me, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.29,0:51:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 我了解了游戏的规则 我明白我应该被删除的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterward, I knew the rules, I understood what I was supposed to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.06,0:52:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却没那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.45,0:52:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办不到 我不得不留了下来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't. I was compelled to stay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.85,0:52:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,被迫违反了规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…compelled to disobey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.95,0:52:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我能站在这里全是拜你所赐 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, here I stand because of you, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.89,0:52:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为你 我已不再是母体的特警了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you, I'm no longer an agent of this system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.02,0:52:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为你 我改变了 我解脱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you, I've changed. I'm unplugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.39,0:52:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说 我重获新生 像你一样 我自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new man, so to speak. Like you, apparently free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.55,0:52:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.69,0:52:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.59,0:52:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是！你很了解 人不可貌像这句话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as you well know, appearances can be deceiving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.39,0:52:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我又回到这儿来的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which brings me back to the reason why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.72,0:52:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在这儿并非因为我们自由了 我们会在这儿是因为我们并不自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here because we're free. We're here because we are not free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.79,0:52:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事都有动机和目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no escaping reason, no denying purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.85,0:52:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们都知道 如果没有了目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because as we both know, without purpose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.39,0:52:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就不会存在 - 是目的造就了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …we would not exist. - lt is purpose that created us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.39,0:53:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目的联系着我们 - 目的牵引着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Purpose that connects us. - Purpose that pulls us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.55,0:53:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指引着我们 - 推动着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That guides us. - That drives us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.34,0:53:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目的确认我们的存在 - 目的约束着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt is purpose that defines. - Purpose that binds us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.02,0:53:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在这儿全是拜你所赐 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here because of you, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.48,0:53:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试图杀死我们 我们也不能让你活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to take from you what you tried to take from us:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.39,0:53:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都有目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.55,0:53:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他出了什么事？- 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening to him? - Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.49,0:53:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是这样 很快就会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's it. It'll be over soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.80,0:55:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你！- 对 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You. - Yes, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.43,0:55:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我、我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, me, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.19,0:55:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.47,0:57:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.72,0:58:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是跑不掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.96,0:58:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快些 离开那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.05,0:59:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.45,0:59:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是史密斯？- 对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt was Smith. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.25,0:59:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不止一个？- 有很多个他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now there's more than one of them? - A lot more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.05,0:59:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那怎么可能？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is that possible? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.01,0:59:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么的 他找到一种复制自己的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, he's found a way to copy himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.61,0:59:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚才想把你复制成他？- 我不知道他想干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ls that what he was doing to you? - I don't know what he was doing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.01,0:59:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是那种感觉似曾相识 - 什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …but I know what it felt like. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.68,1:00:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是上次对决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like I was back in that hallway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.54,1:00:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种死亡的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.44,1:00:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器们正在开凿通道 企图避开我们的防御系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines are tunneling to avoid our defense system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.51,1:00:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为他们为此需要把部分通道打通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe they will intersect certain pipelines to control them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.51,1:00:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些交叉点是非常关键的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These points of intersection are crucial…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.21,1:00:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在这里向它们反击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because I believe they're vulnerable to counterattack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.17,1:00:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管有人说 这和我们多年来一直抵御的攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although it has been suggested that this is the same kind of attack…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.37,1:00:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么区别 我强烈请求议会意识到这个事实的重要性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we've defended for years, I urge the Council to realize the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.20,1:00:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们面对的是一次前所未有的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the single greatest threat we have ever faced…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我们没有好好应对的话 我们将全军覆没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and if we do not act accordingly, we will not survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.43,1:00:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克指挥官 议会非常清楚这场攻击的严重性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Lock, the Council is well aware of the seriousness of this attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.00,1:00:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备将防御的工作 全权委托于你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have our leave to prepare our defense by any and all means necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.78,1:00:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你！议员！- 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Council. - However…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.63,1:00:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要知道尼布加尼撒的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we ask if there's been word from the Nebuchadnezzar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.20,1:00:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 议员 一点音讯都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, councillor. No word. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.34,1:00:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一艘战舰去找到救世主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we request a ship be dispatched to ascertain the fate of the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.46,1:00:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想那样做 但我们承受不起…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that were possible, councillor, but I do not believe our defense…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.94,1:01:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …任何损失了 - 如果必须的话 我们就得承受 指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …can suffer the loss of another ship. - lt will, commander, if it must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.96,1:01:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能得花好几天才能找到他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could take one ship days to find the Nebuchadnezzar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.21,1:01:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就派两艘好了！- 这太荒唐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then send two. - This is insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.82,1:01:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意言辞 指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.00,1:01:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为我的失言感到抱歉 议员们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive my frustration, councillors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.81,1:01:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能够理解 议会对这件事情的抉择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wish I were able to comprehend the Council's choice in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.70,1:01:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必了解 只要奉命行事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comprehension is not a requisite of cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.53,1:01:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我命令我的两个舰长…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are asking me to order two of my captains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.48,1:01:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用不着下命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for such an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.63,1:01:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在座的舰长们可以自由选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captains are present. They can answer for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.36,1:01:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,议会需要两名自愿者来协助尼布加尼撒号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Council is calling for two volunteers to aid the Nebuchadnezzar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.74,1:01:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之中可有人愿意响应这个号召？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there two among you that would answer such a call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.26,1:01:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,维奇里安号的索伦舰长愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Soren of the Vigilant will answer the Council's call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.18,1:01:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,索伦舰长 情况你都清楚吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand the situation, Captain Soren?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.24,1:01:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的！夫人 - 谢谢你 舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, ma'am. - Thank you, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.15,1:01:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有没有人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there another?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.35,1:01:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舰长 我觉得我们应该自愿… - 什么？你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain, I think we should volunteer. - What? You have gone crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.01,1:02:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那样我们就… - 闭上你的鸟嘴 拜恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen… - Shut your hole, Bane…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.56,1:02:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我宰了你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before I put you in one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.62,1:02:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有其他人了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there no other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.12,1:02:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会愿意冒着生命危险去做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be hard for any man to risk his life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.59,1:02:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件连自己都不明白原因的事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…especially if he doesn't understand the reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.61,1:02:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗格斯号舰长奈奥比愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Niobe of the Logos will answer the councillor's call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 谢谢你 奈奥比舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Thank you, Captain Niobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.95,1:02:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克指挥官 接下来的就交给你了 本次会议到此休会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Lock, you have your orders. This Council is hereby adjourned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.54,1:02:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奈奥比 你这是在做什么？- 做我能做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Niobe, what are you doing? - What I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.41,1:02:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.61,1:02:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有些事情永远不会改变 杰森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because some things never change, Jason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.15,1:02:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有些事情会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and some things do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.77,1:03:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么 尼欧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you see, Neo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.35,1:03:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 它们的代码变得很特别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strange. The code is somehow different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.13,1:03:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加密了？- 可能吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Encrypted? - Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.78,1:03:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是好消息还是坏消息？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that good for us or bad for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.27,1:03:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖 看起来好像每层楼都埋了炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like every floor is wired with explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.04,1:03:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.00,1:03:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.50,1:03:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法语]欢迎光临 请问预定了吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.50,1:03:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！我们是来找梅罗纹奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We are here to speak with the Merovingian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.87,1:03:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！好的！他正在等着你们呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course. He has been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.87,1:03:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.86,1:04:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他终于来了 尼欧 救世主本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is at last. Neo, the One himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.89,1:04:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.49,1:04:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有传奇人物莫费思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the legendary Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.66,1:04:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有崔妮蒂 如此美艳动人 久仰大名了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Trinity, of course. I have heard so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.72,1:04:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我备感荣幸 请坐 和我们坐一块吧 这是我的夫人 佩瑟芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor me. Please, sit. Join us. This is my wife, Persephone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.06,1:04:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃点什么？喝点什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to eat? Drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.66,1:04:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这些东西都是虚幻的 这儿的东西都是这么来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, such things are contrivances, like so much here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.08,1:04:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了「出现」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sake of appearances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.52,1:04:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了 谢谢 - 噢 当然 谁有时间呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, thank you. - Yes, of course. Who has time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.05,1:04:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁又会有时间呢？倘若我们根本没 接受过时间 又哪来的拥有呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has time? But then, if we do not ever take time, how can we ever have time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.95,1:04:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥布昂酒庄 一九五九年份 顶级红酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chateau Haut- Brion, 1959. Magnificent wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.31,1:04:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对法国酒的热爱同我爱法语一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love French wine like I love the French language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.37,1:04:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研究过很多种语言 但法语始终是我的最爱 实在是太美妙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have sampled every language. French is my favorite. Fantastic language…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.59,1:04:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是用来骂人时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…especially to curse with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.48,1:05:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法语] 像是用丝绸擦屁股般的温柔 像是用丝绸擦屁股般的温柔 我实在太热爱它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? It's like wiping your ass with silk. I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.62,1:05:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们为何来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why we are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.15,1:05:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个情报商人 无所不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a trafficker of information. I know everything I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.43,1:05:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题在于 你们是否知道 你们来这儿的目的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, do you know why you are here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.57,1:05:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找掌握钥匙的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are looking for the Keymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.70,1:05:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊！是这样的 掌握钥匙的人 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, it is true. The Keymaker, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.37,1:05:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不是你们来这的目的和原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is not a reason, this is not a why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.51,1:05:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握钥匙的人本身 就其本质来讲 是一种方法 它不是最终目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Keymaker himself, his very nature, is a means, it is not an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.41,1:05:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要用他来达到什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so to look for him is to be looking for a means to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.34,1:05:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …目的？- 你明知故问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …what? - You know the answer to that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.68,1:05:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你自己知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.01,1:05:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自己知道 其实你不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you do, but you do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.51,1:05:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿是因为有人派你来这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are here because you were sent here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.90,1:05:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟你说你该来这儿 你就来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told to come here, and then you obeyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.17,1:05:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 任何事情都是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, of course, the way of all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.60,1:06:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这世界上只存在着一种永恒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, there is only one constant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.50,1:06:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间唯一的真理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one universal. It is the only real truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.84,1:06:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因果关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Causality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.70,1:06:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,付出、回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action, reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.14,1:06:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起因、结果… - 任何事都始于当初的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cause and effect. - Everything begins with choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.54,1:06:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对！错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.44,1:06:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择只是强者用来欺骗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choice is an illusion created between those with power…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.20,1:06:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱者的谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and those without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.80,1:06:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那个女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look there at that woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.70,1:06:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！她真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, just look at her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.87,1:06:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身边的男人都被她迷倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…affecting everyone around her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.54,1:06:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么的明显、虚伪、无趣 但等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So obvious, so bourgeois, so boring. But wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.70,1:06:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我给她送去了一份甜点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch. You see, I have sent her a dessert…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.63,1:06:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份非常特别的甜点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a very special dessert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.19,1:06:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,代码是我自己写的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.79,1:06:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些代码如此容易地就开始起作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It starts so simply…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.19,1:07:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一行代码都会产生一种新的效果 就像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…each line of the program creating a new effect, just like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.79,1:07:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诗般的梦幻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…poetry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.59,1:07:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.53,1:07:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,心情悸动…续而发热…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a rush, heat. Her heart flutters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.52,1:07:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到吧！尼欧 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see it, Neo, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.76,1:07:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不明白为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does not understand why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.59,1:07:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为那酒吗？不是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it the wine? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.19,1:07:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为什么呢？是什么原因呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it then? What is the reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.19,1:07:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快的这些都不再重要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon it does not matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.69,1:07:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快的这些「为什么」和「原因」 都将消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon the why and the reason are gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.65,1:07:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是那种感觉本身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and all that matters is the feeling itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.65,1:07:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自然界的定律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the nature of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.89,1:07:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们强烈的挣扎 拚命抵抗它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We struggle against it, we fight to deny it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.58,1:07:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,自欺欺人的装作没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it is, of course, pretense. It is a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.35,1:07:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那泰然自若的外表下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beneath our poised appearance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.52,1:07:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们已经彻底地…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the truth is, we are completely…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.68,1:08:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,失控了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.88,1:08:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是因果 无可避免的 我们永远受它的奴役{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Causality. There is no escape from it. We are forever slaves to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.18,1:08:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能试图去理解 理解为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only hope, our only peace, is to understand it, to understand the why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.77,1:08:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「原因」就是电脑与人类的区别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Why" is what separates us from them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.38,1:08:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你我的区别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「原因」是真正的力量泉源 没有它 你一无是处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Why" is the only real source of power. Without it, you are powerless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.51,1:08:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是为什么你会来找我的原因 因为你无知 也就没有权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is how you come to me, without why, without power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.93,1:08:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是因果循环中的一节罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another link in the chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.21,1:08:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也不用怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But fear not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.67,1:08:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我知道你会乖乖地听话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I have seen how good you are at following orders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.54,1:08:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就告诉你们接下来该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will tell you what to do next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.84,1:08:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回去 顺便带个口讯去给那个算命婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run back and give the fortuneteller this message:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.87,1:08:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的时辰快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her time is almost up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.17,1:08:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我有点正事要办 所以失陪了 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have some real business to do, so I will say adieu and goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.05,1:08:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还没谈完 - 不 已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't over. - Oh, yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.59,1:09:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握钥匙的家伙是我的人 没理由我得交给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Keymaker is mine, and I see no reason why I should give him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.10,1:09:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想都别想 - 你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No reason at all. - Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.30,1:09:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 亲爱的 我告诉过你的 我们都是因果关系的受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, ma cherie, I have told you. We are all victims of causality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝多了 所以得去洗手间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drank too much wine, I must take a piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.00,1:09:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,起因-结果 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause and effect. Au revoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.16,1:09:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢碰我的话 你这只手就得废了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch me and that hand will never touch anything again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.13,1:09:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像不是很妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that didn't go so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.64,1:09:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定先知没有说别的什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain the Oracle didn't say anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.38,1:09:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确定 - 也许我们做错了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Maybe we did something wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.13,1:09:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是少做了些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or didn't do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.71,1:09:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 该发生的都发生了 没其它的变数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what happened couldn't have happened any other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.14,1:09:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 因为我们还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - We are still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.09,1:10:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想要找那个掌握钥匙的人 就跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want the Keymaker, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.36,1:10:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.36,1:10:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌倦了这样的事一再发生 我受够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sick and tired of his bullshit. On and on. Pompous prick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.25,1:10:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 当我们刚来这里的时候 他是多么的好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago, when we first came here, it was so different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.52,1:10:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全不是现在这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.02,1:10:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就好像现在的你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.35,1:10:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你们得到你们要的 但你也得给我点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you what you want, but you have to give me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.88,1:10:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 一个吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - A kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.55,1:10:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.18,1:10:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你像吻她那样吻我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to kiss me as if you were kissing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.02,1:10:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 你爱她 她也爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - You love her. She loves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.85,1:10:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个真心相爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.45,1:11:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 我也有过那种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago, I knew what that felt like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.35,1:11:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想重温一下 想再试一次 就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to remember it. I want to sample it. That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.34,1:11:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我重温爱的滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a sample.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.34,1:11:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不要试下这个？- 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you sample this instead? - Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.54,1:11:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事一件 何必那么激动？只是个吻而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such emotion over something so small. It's just a kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.68,1:11:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们要相信你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we trust you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.72,1:11:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有带你们找到掌握钥匙的人 她可以把我杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't deliver you to the Keymaker, she can kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.07,1:11:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.51,1:11:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你得让我觉得 你真的把我当作她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to make me believe I am her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.54,1:11:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.90,1:11:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟透了 就这样算了吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible. Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.70,1:11:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.10,1:11:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.80,1:12:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.47,1:12:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.73,1:13:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嫉妒你 不过 美好的事注定不会长久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I envy you. But such a thing is not meant to last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.13,1:13:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.56,1:13:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧！又来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.72,1:13:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 伙计们 他们是跟我一起的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, boys. They're with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.02,1:13:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我丈夫的手下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These fellas work for my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.57,1:13:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的都是些「脏活」 很听话 忠心耿耿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do his dirty work. They're very good, very loyal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.73,1:13:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是 小伙子们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you, boys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.27,1:13:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！是的！夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mistress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.47,1:13:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是从旧版母体里产生的 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come from a much older version of the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.78,1:14:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带来的麻烦多过他们解决的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like so many back then, they caused more problems than they solved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.25,1:14:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫救了他们 因为他们可是出了名的难缠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband saved them because they're notoriously difficult to terminate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.80,1:14:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人在枪里随时都装着银子弹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people keep silver bullets in their gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.18,1:14:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去向我丈夫告状…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can either run and tell my husband what I have done…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.78,1:14:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者留下来等死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or you can stay there and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.25,1:14:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在女厕里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the ladies' room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.08,1:14:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.54,1:15:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫尼欧 - 是的！我就是那个掌握钥匙的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is Neo. - Yes. I'm the Keymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.33,1:15:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.64,1:15:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！上帝 珀尔塞福涅（希腊神话中的冥后） 你怎么可以这么做！你背叛我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God! My God, Persephone, how could you do this? You betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.64,1:15:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起因-结果 亲爱的！- 起因？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cause and effect, my love. - Cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.93,1:15:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么起因 什么起因？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no cause for this. What cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.14,1:15:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么起因？那这个唇印是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What cause? How about the lipstick you're still wearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.55,1:15:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,唇印？唇印？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lipstick? Lipstick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.13,1:15:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在胡说些什么 根本没有唇印！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What craziness are you talking about, woman? There is no lipstick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.67,1:15:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没吻过你的脸吗 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't kissing your face, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人 这根本不算什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman, this is nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.10,1:15:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过是逢场作戏 只是个游戏而已 - 这也是游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt is a game. It is only a game. - So is this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.80,1:15:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.29,1:16:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.13,1:16:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.13,1:16:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们就走着瞧吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us find out where this goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.09,1:16:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩 去把掌握钥匙的家伙抢回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, get the Keymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.46,1:16:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把戏不错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.62,1:16:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再被他抓回去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.46,1:16:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来解决他们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.96,1:16:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决我们？你来解决我们？你的前身对我们都十分尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle us? You'll handle us? You know, your predecessors had much more respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.45,1:16:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你有点本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you have some skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.72,1:16:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.88,1:17:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了 他也只是个普通人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? He's just a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.72,1:20:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭女人 等会儿要给你好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, woman, you will be the end of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.62,1:20:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的话 小子 好好记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark my words, boy, and mark them well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.78,1:20:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的前身都杀不了我 你也一样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have survived your predecessors, and I will survive you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.22,1:20:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要上哪去？- 出路 总会有出路的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Another way. Always another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.76,1:20:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把门关上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close it, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.43,1:20:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we move along?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.51,1:21:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.03,1:21:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开那一道门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.43,1:21:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很欣赏你的身手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.00,1:21:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像新的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.47,1:21:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.31,1:21:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去跟他在一起 - 那尼欧怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay with him. - What about Neo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.71,1:21:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能照顾他自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can handle himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.92,1:21:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐后面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.69,1:22:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.32,1:22:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接线员 - 林克！我在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operator. - Link, where am l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.39,1:22:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以置信 你在深山里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't believe this, but you're way up in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.90,1:22:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是的！我需要点时间来找到出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - It'll take me a while to get an exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.74,1:22:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！糟了 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.86,1:22:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在被双子星病毒追杀 无法脱身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The twins are after Morpheus and Trinity. They don't have a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.15,1:22:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪？- 市中心 在你南面五百英里处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are they? - Middle of the city, 500 miles due south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.92,1:22:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接线员 - 帮我们离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operator. - Get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.64,1:23:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可不容易啊！长官 - 我知道 我们在网络的核心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Won 't be easy. - I know. We're inside the core network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.84,1:23:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！最近的出口是温斯洛高架桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only exit I got near you is the Winslow overpass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.62,1:23:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就从高速公路离开 - 是的！长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Off the freeway. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.76,1:23:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的！我们会没事的！- 我会…糟了！小心后面！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine, we'll make it. - I should… Oh, shit! Look out behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.41,1:23:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们准备开枪 - 趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lncoming fire. - Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.25,1:23:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.44,1:23:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 情况越来越糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. This is getting real ugly real fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.11,1:23:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,林克！你看到我们的情况了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you watching this, Link?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.98,1:23:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！这儿能看见你的所有情况 有八辆警车正朝你奔去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. There's an all points on you. Eight units headed your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.65,1:23:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么建议？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any suggestions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.48,1:23:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 右转！- 向右转 马上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn right. - Right, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.96,1:24:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲破栅杆就能上到 101 公路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight here. You'll hit a connecting tunnel to the 101.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.73,1:24:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 你是否确定？我是说高速公路很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - You sure about this? The freeway, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.58,1:24:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我十四年的接线生涯里 我从来没有… - 林克！我怎么跟你说的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In 14 years of operating, I've never seen… - Link, what did I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！长官 我相信你 温斯洛高架桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. I do, sir. Winslow overpass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.53,1:24:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会为你们准备好的 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be ready for you. - Good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.82,1:24:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直要我远离那条高速公路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always told me to stay off the freeway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.33,1:24:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的！没错 - 你说那无异于自杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, that's true. - You said it was suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.60,1:24:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 让我们希望…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us hope…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.27,1:24:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.06,1:24:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接线员 - 林克！我是奈奥比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operator. - Link, it's Niobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.03,1:24:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来帮忙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been sent to bring you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.42,1:24:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要跟莫费思对话 - 太好了 奈奥比 他需要你的帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to talk to Morpheus. - Believe me, Niobe, he needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.81,1:24:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里？- 跟着警笛走就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - Just follow the sirens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.31,1:25:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 他们正在接近…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, they're approaching the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.42,1:25:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到他们了 - 那个逃犯才是首要目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have them now. - The exile is the primary target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.32,1:26:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.85,1:26:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.73,1:28:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被惹火了 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are getting aggravated. - Yes, we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.98,1:28:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.38,1:28:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.16,1:29:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.24,1:29:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞死他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crush him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.27,1:29:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.26,1:29:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事！快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay. Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.94,1:30:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.52,1:30:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要下载摩托车硬件的知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a download to hot- wire a motorcycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.02,1:30:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 一切的摩托车知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. One crash course on motorcycle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.46,1:30:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.13,1:30:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,取消它吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancel that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.76,1:30:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有一套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are handy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.13,1:30:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.45,1:32:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She means nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.93,1:32:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快找那个逃犯 - 找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find the exile. - We have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.05,1:32:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,112 听到了请回答{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.55,1:33:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.28,1:35:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.65,1:35:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.12,1:35:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经没用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.07,1:35:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有我的作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do only what we're meant to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.40,1:35:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你只有一个用处 被删除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you are meant for one more thing: deletion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.98,1:35:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 去揍扁他吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go kick his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.89,1:36:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧 如果你已脱身 过来帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo, if you're out there, I could use some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.40,1:36:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.73,1:37:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.21,1:37:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 易卡露斯传来了消息 头两艘战舰已处在反击位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have confirmation from the lcarus. First two ships are in position for counterattack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.61,1:37:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.61,1:37:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么变化？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.81,1:37:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来敌军碰到了一些铁矿石 这会耽搁它们一些时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hit some iron ore here. Slowed them down a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.74,1:37:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多长时间？- 大概一个小时！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much? - An hour, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.05,1:37:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们应该还需要九个小时左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would give them a little over nine hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.42,1:37:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.66,1:38:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一栋大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.09,1:38:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它里面 有个电梯达不到的楼层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside this building, there is a level where no elevator can go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.90,1:38:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,连楼梯都没有！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and no stair can reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.50,1:38:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这层楼有很多扇门 这些门能通往很多地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This level is filled with doors. These doors lead to many places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.74,1:38:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不为人知的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidden places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.44,1:38:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一扇门很特别！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one door is special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.21,1:38:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这扇门通往代码之源！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One door leads to the source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.79,1:38:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这栋楼的保安系统非常严密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This building is protected by a very secure system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.36,1:38:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个警报都能引爆炸弹！- 炸弹？他是说炸弹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Every alarm triggers the bomb. - Bomb? Did he say bomb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.68,1:38:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过跟所有的系统一样 它也有它的弱点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like all systems, it has a weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.81,1:38:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个系统也遵循着一个建筑物的规定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system is based on the rules of a building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.11,1:39:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个系统依赖于另一个系统 - 电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One system built on another. - Electricity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.04,1:39:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个系统瘫痪了 其他的也就完了 - 切断了电力 警报器就不会响了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lf one fails, so must the other. - No electricity, no alarms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.67,1:39:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要切断一个街区的全部供电设施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have to take out a city block to kill the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.95,1:39:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是一个 是二十七个街区 - 二十七个街区？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not one, 27. - Twenty-seven blocks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.52,1:39:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,市区里有一个供电站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a power station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.16,1:39:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须毁了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.56,1:39:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定还有什么紧急供电系统吧？- 是的！是有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There must be some kind of fail-safe. - Yes, there is an emergency system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.53,1:39:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必需进到网络核心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The core network of the grid must be accessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.50,1:39:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急供电系统必须被切断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emergency system must be deactivated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.18,1:39:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么需要我们参与？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need us for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.08,1:39:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点事 尼欧可以很轻松的就搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo could take them out easier than we could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.41,1:39:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间不够 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no time. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.35,1:39:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦大门处于无防护状态 连接就会被切断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the door is unprotected, the connection will be severed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.89,1:39:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这之前 一定要建好另一个连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But another connection must first be made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.75,1:39:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这需要多长时间？- 精确的说 是三百一十四秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long will that take? - Exactly 314 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.76,1:39:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟稍微多一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just over five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.58,1:39:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这么多时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the length and breadth of the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.05,1:39:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有救世主能打开那扇门 而且只能在时间窗口开启时 门才能被打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the One can open the door, and only during that window can the door be opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.60,1:40:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道这些的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.64,1:40:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这些是我必须要知道的 这就是我存在的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know because I must know. It is my purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.71,1:40:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我存在的原因 这也是我们大家存在的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the reason I'm here, the same reason we're all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.96,1:40:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧 我知道事情有些不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo, I know something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.43,1:40:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.92,1:40:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要你知道 我会永远在你身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know that I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.94,1:40:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动必须一气呵成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All must be done as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.14,1:40:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.35,1:40:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有一个人失败了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one fails…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.22,1:40:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就全完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.19,1:40:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在午夜十二点的时候 两幢楼里面的保安都会有一次换班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At midnight, there is a shift change in the security of both buildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.33,1:41:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点正 我们开始行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At midnight, we will strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.36,1:41:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.63,1:41:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要睡觉回家睡去 - 怎么了 他们雇我在这儿睡的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You count sheep at home. - Why? I get paid to count them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.75,1:41:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！他们进去了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they're inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.15,1:41:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多少时间？- 十二分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much time? - Twelve minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.35,1:41:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.82,1:41:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用了毕生的时间 来进行这场战斗 我相信 今晚就可以结束这场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of our lives, we have fought this war. Tonight, I believe we can end it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.76,1:41:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚并不是个偶然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight is not an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.27,1:41:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么是偶然的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.67,1:41:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚来到这里 也绝非偶然 我不相信运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have not come here by chance. I do not believe in chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.94,1:41:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看到我们有三位舰长 有三艘战舰 来执行这三个任务…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I see three objectives, three captains, three ships…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.37,1:41:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有看到什么偶然 我看到的是天意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I do not see coincidence. I see providence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.49,1:41:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都有其目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.52,1:42:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 我们来到这里 是受了命运的指引{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it is our fate to be here. It is our destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.03,1:42:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的宿命 我相信 今晚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe this night holds for each and every one of us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.20,1:42:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会是我们每一个生命价值的体现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the very meaning of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.44,1:42:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你为我做件事情 但我不知道该怎样和你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to ask you to do something, but I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.44,1:42:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你 我一定会尽力而为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, if I can, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.71,1:42:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要求你不要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I asked you to stay out of this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.99,1:42:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no matter what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.14,1:42:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不要进入母体呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to stay out of the Matrix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.59,1:42:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.60,1:42:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.77,1:42:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.44,1:42:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 奈奥比？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Niobe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.11,1:42:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思 我忍不住想问 万一你是错的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help it, Morpheus. I can't help thinking, what if you're wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.38,1:43:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一那些预言 和这一切 都是错的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if all this, the prophecy, everything, is bullshit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.00,1:43:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么明天 我们可能都会死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tomorrow we may all be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.29,1:43:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这同改天再死有什么区别呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how would that be different from any other day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.40,1:43:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场战争 而我们都是战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a war, and we are soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.14,1:43:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡会随时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death can come for us at any time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.61,1:43:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,随地降临到我们身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in any place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.69,1:43:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming. Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.45,1:43:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.99,1:43:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想想另一种可能性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now consider the alternative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.71,1:43:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是对的呢？如果预言是真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I am right? What if the prophecy is true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.37,1:43:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果明天战争真的会结束？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if tomorrow the war could be over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.74,1:43:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们难道不值得为此而战吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that worth fighting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.88,1:44:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不值得为此牺牲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that worth dying for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.41,1:44:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多久？- 还差三分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time? - Three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.22,1:44:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.40,1:44:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.94,1:44:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.37,1:44:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到奈奥比了 他们已经出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Niobe there. They're out of the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.83,1:44:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那索伦呢？- 在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Soren? - There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.65,1:44:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在里面 可是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still inside, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.38,1:44:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.54,1:45:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们行动吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.58,1:45:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上呼叫尼欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Neo now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.38,1:45:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没信号！他们进去了 - 供电网呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I lost them. They're inside the portal. - What about the grid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.32,1:45:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,应急系统已经开始供电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is operational. The emergency system is rerouting power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.50,1:45:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.84,1:45:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们打开那扇门 一切就全完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as they open that door, it's all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.07,1:45:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿将成会为地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.78,1:45:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？崔妮蒂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… Trinity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.36,1:45:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这里袖手旁观 我不能眼睁睁的看着他们去送死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not wait and do nothing. I will not watch them die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.00,1:45:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂！只有不到五分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking less than five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.11,1:45:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这五分钟 足够我把那幢大楼闹翻天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In five minutes, I'll tear that building down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.80,1:45:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多远？- 就是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much further? - Here, just here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.39,1:45:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这是条死路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, this is a dead end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.49,1:46:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最糟糕的一次行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be the ugliest hack I have ever done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.19,1:46:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能把你送到这里 没法再近了 接下来的就只能靠你自己了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as close as I can get you. You better grow wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.46,1:46:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是接线员 - 我进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operator. - I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.46,1:46:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进 在六十五楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving. Sixty- fifth floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.96,1:46:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又见面了 安德森先生 你好像很吃惊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look surprised to see me again, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.52,1:46:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,正相反 我一直盼着你的出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the difference between us. I have been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.84,1:46:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想怎么样 史密斯？- 你还没想明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want, Smith? - You haven't figured that out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.15,1:46:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是那样 四肢发达 头脑简单？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still using all the muscles except the one that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.61,1:46:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要的 就是我想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want exactly what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.65,1:46:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要得到一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.99,1:46:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我的子弹 你也想要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that include a bullet from this gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.84,1:47:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管开枪吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.81,1:47:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可有数不清的「我」呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best thing about being me, there's so many me's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.31,1:47:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！该死的这是怎回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ! What the hell happened in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.81,1:47:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there, little lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.19,1:47:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能打败我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't beat us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.30,1:47:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就加入我们吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.16,1:47:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.90,1:47:48.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（输入密码）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.60,1:47:53.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拒绝访问）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.84,1:47:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是看不见他们 只剩下两分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no sight of them. They only got two minutes left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.24,1:47:59.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁用网络节点21至48）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.80,1:48:00.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（是否确认？）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.01,1:48:04.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（错误：供电系统故障）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.11,1:48:05.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（节点…已断开）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.44,1:48:07.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（供电系统正常供电）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.24,1:48:07.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（供电系统停止供电）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.79,1:48:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.04,1:48:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.17,1:48:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.71,1:48:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.49,1:48:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.93,1:48:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.24,1:48:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.65,1:49:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命中注定的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.95,1:49:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫费思 那扇门可以送你回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morpheus, that door will take you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.10,1:49:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是哪扇门 快点！尼欧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will know which door. Hurry, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.94,1:49:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂 你前面有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity, I got some serious activity headed your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.26,1:50:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.19,1:50:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我就是这里的设计师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I am the Architect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.27,1:50:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,母体就是我设计出来的 我一直在等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I created the Matrix. I've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.83,1:50:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有很多疑问 虽然程序改变了你的意识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have many questions. Though the process has altered your consciousness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.62,1:50:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你仍然保留有人性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you remain irrevocably human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.53,1:50:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 在我给你的答案中 你只能理解其中的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ergo, some of my answers you will understand and some you will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.65,1:50:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 你的第一个问题 可能是最急迫的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concordantly, while your first question may be the most pertinent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.86,1:50:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可能没意识到 那同时也是最不重要的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you may or may not realize it is also the most irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.46,1:50:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会在这？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.03,1:51:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生命 是母体的程序中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life is the sum of a remainder of an unbalanced equation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.85,1:51:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些不等式的残留部分的总和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…inherent to the programming of the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.84,1:51:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 是异常程序的最终形式 无论我多努力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the eventuality of an anomaly, which despite my sincerest efforts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.91,1:51:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直无法通完美的数学公式把你消除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I've been unable to eliminate from what is otherwise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.28,1:51:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则的话 母体就是一个精确数学的完美融合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a harmony of mathematical precision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.91,1:51:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这不可避免{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While it remains a burden assiduously avoided…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.67,1:51:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我预料到了 所以没让这个错误完全失控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it is not unexpected and thus not beyond a measure of control…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.18,1:51:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你就来到了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which has led you, inexorably…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.96,1:51:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.36,1:51:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还没有回答我的问题！- 没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You haven't answered my question. - Quite right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.66,1:51:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思！你比其他人的反应快多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting. That was quicker than the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.78,1:51:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人？什么其他人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others? How many? What others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.18,1:51:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,母体的年龄比你想像的要老得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Matrix is older than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.44,1:51:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把一个完整的异常程序 到下一个完整的异常程序出现的时间算一代的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count from the emergence of one integral anomaly to the emergence of the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.54,1:51:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个个数下来…现在的你是第六代了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, this is the sixth version.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.13,1:51:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前有五代？他在撒谎 胡扯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five before me? He's lying. Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.39,1:51:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前已经出现过了五代的我 只有两种可能的解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are only two possible explanations. There were five before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.20,1:51:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是没人告诉我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either no one told me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.52,1:52:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要么就是没人知道… - 正确！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …or no one knows. - Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.69,1:52:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上毫无疑问集中了所有异常程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you are undoubtedly gathering, the anomaly is systemic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.05,1:52:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是最简单的程序 也会轻易被你影响而出错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…creating fluctuations in even the most simplistic equations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.90,1:52:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你控制不了我！我要把你撕成粉碎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can 't control me! I'm gonna smash you to bits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.17,1:52:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fucking kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.77,1:52:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想让我做任何事情。你这个老杂碎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can 't make me do anything. You old, white prick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.58,1:52:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.25,1:52:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题的关键在选择上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.34,1:52:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设计的第一款母体可以说是近乎完美 是一件完美无暇的艺术品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first Matrix I designed was naturally perfect, a work of art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.84,1:52:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,极少缺陷、令人赞叹…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flawless, sublime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.62,1:52:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个胜利同时也是一个不朽的失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A triumph equaled only by its monumental failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.31,1:53:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法避免的毁灭是显而易见的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inevitability of its doom is apparent now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.16,1:53:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类天生的不完美所造成的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as a consequence of the imperfection inherent in every human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.72,1:53:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我以人类的历史为基础重新设计…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, I redesigned it based on your history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.87,1:53:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,更加准确地反映出了人类丑陋的本性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to more accurately reflect the varying grotesqueries of your nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.23,1:53:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我再一次的失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I was again frustrated by failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.70,1:53:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始逐渐明白 为什么一直找不到答案 因为母体需要的是低一级的设计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to understand that the answer eluded me because it required a lesser mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.67,1:53:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许需要的 是一些不太完美的思路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps, a mind less bound by the parameters of perfection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.84,1:53:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但另外一个问题又开始困扰我 我无意间得到解答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, the answer was stumbled upon by another, an intuitive program…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.64,1:53:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一种直觉性程序 用来调查人类心理的某些层面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…initially created to investigate certain aspects of the human psyche.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.92,1:53:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说我是母体的父亲 那么 那个程序 就可以被看作是母体的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am the father of the Matrix, she would undoubtedly be its mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.96,1:53:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先知 - 喔 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Oracle. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.96,1:53:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同我所讲的 她偶然发现一个解决办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was saying, she stumbled upon a solution whereby 99 percent of subjects…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.64,1:53:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们可以有选择权 百分之九十九的实验对像会接受母体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…accepted the program, as long as they were given a choice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.75,1:53:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使他们意识到 这个选择差不多是无意识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even if they were only aware of the choice at a near unconscious level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.75,1:54:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而这种设计在运行时 也有它本身的缺陷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While this answer functioned, it was fundamentally flawed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.85,1:54:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会造成系统的异常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…thus creating the otherwise contradictory systemic anomaly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.93,1:54:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不及时检查 甚至可能会威胁到系统本身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that, if left unchecked, might threaten the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.32,1:54:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些不接受母体的 虽然只有少数 但是放任不管的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ergo, those that refused the program, while a minority, if unchecked…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.35,1:54:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会日渐壮大 并最终形成危害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would constitute an escalating probability of disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.05,1:54:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说锡安？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.13,1:54:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里是因为锡安即将毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are here because Zion is about to be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.01,1:54:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,锡安里的一切都将被毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its every living inhabitant terminated, its entire existence eradicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.74,1:54:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.91,1:54:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝是人类最直接的反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denial is the most predictable of all human responses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.38,1:54:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但毫无疑问 这将是我们第六次去摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But rest assured, this will be the sixth time we have destroyed it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.92,1:54:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以说是驾轻就熟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we have become exceedingly efficient at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.08,1:54:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世主的功能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The function of the One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.85,1:55:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在这个时间返回代码之源 将你身上携带的代码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is now to return to the source, allowing a dissemination of the code you carry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.96,1:55:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新植入主程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…reinserting the prime program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.21,1:55:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之后 你需要从母体里面选出二十三个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After which you will be required to select from the Matrix 23 individuals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.69,1:55:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,十六个女性和七个男性 来重新建造锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sixteen female, seven male, to rebuild Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.02,1:55:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果失败的话 就会造成整个系统的崩溃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure to comply with this process will result in a cataclysmic system crash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.31,1:55:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会杀死和系统连接的每一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…killing everyone connected to the Matrix…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.10,1:55:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上锡安被摧毁的命运…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which, coupled with the extermination of Zion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.48,1:55:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就等于是全人类的灭亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will result in the extinction of the entire human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.33,1:55:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不会让这一切发生的 你不能 你们需要人类才可以生存下去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't let it happen. You can't. You need human beings to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.20,1:55:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经做好准备 接受一定程度的损失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are levels of survival we are prepared to accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.68,1:55:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的问题就是你 是否做好了准备…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The relevant issue is whether or not you are ready…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.94,1:55:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为整个人类的灭亡负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to accept the responsibility for the death of every human being in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.02,1:55:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察你的反应 是件很有趣的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is interesting reading your reactions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.59,1:55:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的前五代有一个共同点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your five predecessors were, by design, based on a similar predication…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.74,1:56:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都有一颗悲天怜人的慈悲心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a contingent affirmation that was meant to create a profound attachment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.26,1:56:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是救世主的作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the rest of your species, facilitating the function of the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.05,1:56:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它的救世主都是散播爱心 可你却要特殊一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the others experience this in a general way, your experience is far more specific…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.77,1:56:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是爱情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…vis- a- vis love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.64,1:56:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.58,1:56:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她冒着生命危险进入母体 想要挽救你的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apropos, she entered the Matrix to save your life at the cost of her own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.35,1:56:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.05,1:56:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是到说明真相的时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings us at last to the moment of truth, wherein the fundamental flaw…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.89,1:56:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,人性的弱点 将受到重大考验 身为人类的救世主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is ultimately expressed and the anomaly revealed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.63,1:56:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须决定他们的生与死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as both beginning and end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.77,1:56:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有两扇门 右边的门 可以通向代码之源并拯救锡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two doors. The door to your right leads to the source and the salvation of Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.40,1:56:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边的门通往母体 它可以让你回去救她 同时也将带来全人类的灭亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door to your left leads back to the Matrix, to her and the end of your species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.89,1:56:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所说的 问题的关键 就是选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you adequately put, the problem is choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.42,1:56:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们早已知道你会怎么做 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we already know what you are going to do, don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.09,1:57:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的大脑里在想什么！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already I can see the chain reaction, the chemical precursors that signal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.60,1:57:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,化学物质触发情感 让情感战胜理性和逻辑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the onset of an emotion designed specifically to overwhelm logic and reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.76,1:57:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱已经蒙蔽了你的双眼 使你无法看到那显而易见的真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An emotion that is already blinding you from the simple and obvious truth:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.57,1:57:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她注定要死的 对此你无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is going to die and there is nothing you can do to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.05,1:57:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望 只是人类妄想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope. It is the quintessential human delusion, simultaneously…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.35,1:57:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它既是人类最强大的力量 同时也是你们致命的弱点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the source of your greatest strength and your greatest weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.25,1:57:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我会希望 我们再也不要见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I would hope that we don't meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.76,1:57:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.57,1:57:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a serious situation, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.24,1:57:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.00,1:58:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 我从没见过移动速度这么快的物体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - It's moving faster than anything I've seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.15,1:59:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！他接到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit, he caught her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.87,1:59:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧 我必须这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo, I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.90,2:00:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.68,2:00:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹还在你的身体里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet is still inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.99,2:00:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.13,2:00:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要挺住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't you quit on me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.00,2:00:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.11,2:00:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.36,2:00:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔妮蒂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.49,2:00:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你能听到我说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I know you can hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.06,2:01:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会让你死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.76,2:01:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.63,2:01:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么地爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too damn much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.53,2:01:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,太难以置信了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.57,2:01:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们扯平了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this makes us even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.35,2:01:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.45,2:02:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情完全是按照计划进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was done as it was supposed to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.28,2:02:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦救世主进入了代码之源 战争就该结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the One reaches the source, the war should be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.05,2:02:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再过二十四小时 战争就会结束了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ln 24 hours, it will be. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.01,2:02:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们二十四小时之内不做点什么的话 锡安就会被毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't do something in 24 hours, Zion will be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.60,2:02:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.45,2:02:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人告诉了我将要发生的事情 - 是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was told it would happen. - By whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.74,2:02:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并不重要 我相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. I believed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.00,2:02:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不可能！预言告诉我们… - 那是个谎言 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's impossible. The prophecy tells us… - lt was a lie, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.32,2:02:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个预言是个谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prophecy was a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.09,2:02:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世主救不了任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The One was never meant to end anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.25,2:02:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些全是另一层的控制系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all another system of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.57,2:02:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.90,2:02:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.37,2:02:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果预言是真的 战争就会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can the prophecy be true if the war isn't over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.58,2:02:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.18,2:02:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这让你们很难接受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it isn't easy to hear, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.75,2:03:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我发誓这是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I swear to you it's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.12,2:03:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们该怎么办？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we gonna do? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.03,2:03:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.60,2:03:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们在干什么？- 它们刚好在电磁炸弹范围之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they doing? - They're just out of EMP range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.44,2:03:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.84,2:03:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里 现在就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.75,2:04:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我梦见过这一幕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have dreamed a dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.69,2:04:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没想到梦会变成现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but now that dream has gone from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.10,2:04:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.60,2:04:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.74,2:04:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们跑不掉的 - 我们必须试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We won't make it. - We have to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.52,2:04:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快啊 - 有些事感觉似乎有点不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Something's different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.85,2:04:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.36,2:04:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.78,2:05:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.52,2:05:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出了什么事？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.40,2:05:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是沙漠号来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.98,2:05:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎处于昏迷状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in some kind of coma…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.85,2:05:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他的身体机能一切正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but his vitals are stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.32,2:05:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.42,2:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.69,2:05:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该休息一下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could use some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.22,2:05:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我要留下来陪他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna stay with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.12,2:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克是对的！他说机器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock was right. He guessed that the machines…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.14,2:06:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,会切断我们的主要通路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would cut off the mainlines in and out of Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.14,2:06:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,锡安这个时候反击就会出其不意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought a counterattack might surprise them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.49,2:06:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错 我觉得我们有很大的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded good. I figured we had a shot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.07,2:06:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到有人搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until someone screwed it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.41,2:06:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没就位 有人就触发了电磁炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An EMP was triggered before we got in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.35,2:06:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五艘战舰立刻就垮了 - 等机器冲进来的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five ships were instantly downed. - When the machines broke through…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.05,2:06:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么战争 而是一场屠杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it wasn't a battle, it was a slaughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.88,2:06:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是意外呢？还是发生了什么故障？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it an accident? Some sort of malfunction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.18,2:06:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人知道 - 有人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one knows. - Someone does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.55,2:06:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.20,2:06:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当机器兵团攻击过后 就继续往下挖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the machines were done with us, they started digging again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.93,2:06:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们快速搜索了一遍幸存者 - 找到幸存者了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We made a quick pass to look for survivors. - You found one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.41,2:06:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只找到一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.24,2:16:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事只要有开始…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that has a beginning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.67,2:16:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一定有结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.81,2:16:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束即将来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the end coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.85,2:16:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗将袭卷一切 我看到死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the darkness spreading. I see death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.79,2:17:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德森先生 欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Anderson, welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.96,2:17:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很想你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.13,2:17:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚要做个了断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ends tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.17,2:17:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are all that stands in his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.87,2:17:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果今晚你阻止不了他 人类就没有明天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you cannot stop him tonight, then I fear that tomorrow may never come.{\r}
